       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-GESTURAL-PHONETICS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GESTURAL-PHONETIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FORMANT-FILTER-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GESTURAL-PHONETIC-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PITCH-STABILIZE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHONETIC-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GESTURAL-PHO-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GESTURAL-PHONETIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PHO-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PHO-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FORMANT-AND-GESTURE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PITCH-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHO-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FORMANT-AND-GESTURE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FORMANT-FILTER-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GESTURAL-PHONETIC-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PITCH-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PITCH-STABILIZE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHONETIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHO-PROOFS.
           IF WS-FORMANT-FILTER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GESTURAL-PHONETIC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PITCH-STABILIZE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PHONETIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GESTURAL-PHO-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PHO-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PHO-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PHO-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PHO-CODE.
